SET S TO SHIP.
LOCK THROTTLE TO 1.
LOCK STEERING TO HEADING(90,90).
STAGE.
WAIT UNTIL S:THRUST>590.
STAGE.
WAIT UNTIL S:ALTITUDE>5000.
SET T TO 1.
LOCK STEERING TO HEADING(90,90-0.1*T).
WHEN S:ORBIT:VELOCITY:ORBIT:MAG>4450 THEN LOCK THROTTLE TO 0.
UNTIL T>900 {WAIT 0.0285*LN(T).
	SET T TO T+1.
	IF S:THRUST<1 SET T TO 901.}
LOCK THROTTLE TO 1.
STAGE.
WAIT 2.
LOCK THROTTLE TO 0.
LOCK STEERING TO HEADING(90,-4.4).
WAIT UNTIL ETA:APOAPSIS<150.
UNLOCK STEERING.
SET S:CONTROL:ROLL TO 1.
WAIT 50.
LOCK THROTTLE TO 1.
WAIT 30.
LOCK THROTTLE TO 0.
SET ROLL TO 0.
WAIT 0.1.
STAGE.
WAIT 0.5.
LOCK THROTTLE TO 1.
WAIT 5.
WAIT UNTIL S:THRUST < 2.
STAGE.